{
  "skillId": "bankai-skill",
  "displayName": "Bankai Skill",
  "description": "银行AI写作助手——一句话需求即生成59种\"银行味\"公文底稿，严格遵循GB/T 9704-2012格式，内置反编造护栏。需自备DeepSeek API Key。",
  "verificationClass": "official-clawhub",
